    "The T-cell fixed-effects slope was -0.0018645876979979227 versus the H04 slope -0.005643985298968762; the Monocyte fixed-effects slope was -0.0013929260165070846 versus -0.0029276271824344364. Both are less than half the H04 slope magnitude.",
